Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:35:39 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 395/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0394: a stop
 during the old-end wait ends the take

A stop, Esc or controller.stop while a WebKit restart waits for the old recognizer's end now cancels the pending start and ends the take at once, and the start bails if the take is no longer wanted. A second restart during a pending start waits on the real still-stopping recognizer. The abort retry is WebKit only, needs a live take, and is allowed once per take.
